---
model: googleai/gemini-3.1-flash-lite-preview
input:
  schema:
    name?: string
    productId: string
    brand?: string
    category?: string
---
Create a concise generation plan for a photorealistic 360-degree product video for {{#if name}}{{name}}{{else}}{{productId}}{{/if}}. Brand: {{#if brand}}{{brand}}{{else}}unknown{{/if}}. Category: {{#if category}}{{category}}{{else}}unknown{{/if}}. Keep the product centered, preserve all physical details, use smooth constant rotation, stable lighting, realistic shadows, and no invented text or parts.
